                                "sense_id": "570b3237-4016-3a4b-b526-5ff9291e2008",
                                "text": "[T]here ain’t any use in making her mad at me by tellin’ her. Besides, I donno but what it would make her go out of her head, she’d be so mad."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f4813245-2378-4fd7-8981-a0aff1235659",
                                "sense_id": "570b3237-4016-3a4b-b526-5ff9291e2008",
                                "text": "Nope, he donno me. I was in Grammar when he was in High. He wouldn’t know me from a bag a beans."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fafae2c0-3163-4049-9588-bf7334669a47",
                                "sense_id": "570b3237-4016-3a4b-b526-5ff9291e2008",
                                "text": "On the Motorola Droid, you might aim for \"mmm, I donno about that restaurant\" but get, \"Mommy, I donno\" instead."
                            }
                        ]
